    "m3_guide": "<b>How to read this:</b> left to right is turnout. Bottom to top is list votes divided by reported voters. Each coloured cell adds up the registered voters at stations in that cell. Yellow means more registered voters, using a logarithmic scale so both small and large totals are visible. It does not mean more suspicion. A and B mark the fitted centres at lower and higher turnout. The first two panels show Students and Vučić’s list in 2026; the third shows Vučić’s list in 2023 separately. There is no Students list from 2023 in these data.",
